---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site title="email privacy · jp.bent.build">
  <article class="max-w-xl space-y-5 py-10">
    <h1>email privacy</h1>
    <p>
      signing up sends you a confirmation email. you only join the newsletter
      after confirming.
    </p>
    <p>
      we store your email address and signup and confirmation times to send blog
      updates. Resend delivers the emails and manages unsubscribes and delivery
      failures.
    </p>
    <p>
      your address is private. it is never shown on the blog or shared for
      advertising. open and click tracking are disabled.
    </p>
    <p>
      every newsletter has an unsubscribe link. unconfirmed signups are removed
      after seven days. confirmation links expire after 24 hours.
    </p>
    <p>
      reply to a newsletter to contact the owner, including requests to delete
      your subscription data.
    </p>
    <a href="/">BACK TO THE BLOG →</a>
  </article>
</Site>
